		(descr "RP2040 SuperMini / RP2040-Zero on 2.54mm female sockets (1x9 + 1x9 + 1x5), NO castellation pads. Holes on 2.54 grid: long rows 15.24mm apart, GP9-13 in line with GP8/GP14 (Waveshare RP2040-Zero drawing). Viewed from module component side, USB at left: top row GP0..GP8, bottom row 5V,GND,3V3,GP29..GP26,GP15,GP14. Keep on F side (sockets on top, soldered on B.Cu; non-plated holes). Pad 1.8 / drill 1.0")
